  {
    "id": "height-observe",
    "title": "左右子树高度怎样计算？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">约定：空树高度为0，单结点高度为1；非空树的高度按最长根到叶路径所含结点层数计算。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>从树形观察高度</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heightA树形\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">40</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30的左子树高2，右子树高1。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>自底向上计算</h3><div class=\"d17-formula\">h(v) = 1 + max(h(L), h(R))</div><p class=\"d17-note\">结点20两个孩子都是叶子，所以其高度为2。根30整棵树高3。</p><p class=\"d17-note\">高度描述结构深度，不是关键字的数值。</p></div></div></div>",
    "goal": "建立树高约定与递推理解",
    "activity": "从具体树图推导高度",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "avl-definition",
    "title": "什么是 AVL 树的高度平衡条件？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">AVL 树以 Adelson-Velsky 和 Landis 命名：它首先是二叉搜索树，并要求<b>每一个结点</b>的左右子树高度差绝对值不超过1。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>满足约束的例子</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heightA树形\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">40</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30的左右子树高度为2和1，其余结点也合格。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>不满足约束的例子</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heightB树形\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"121\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"121\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"121\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30左侧高2、右侧高0，高差为2。</p></div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">BST顺序条件仍然存在；AVL新增加的是可维护的逐结点高度限制。</p></div>",
    "goal": "明确AVL在BST基础上的逐结点高度约束",
    "activity": "正反例与正式定义",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "bf-calculate",
    "title": "平衡因子 BF 怎样从具体高度算出？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">平衡因子（Balance Factor，BF）是结点的左子树高度减去右子树高度。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>根30的左右子树</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heightA树形\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">40</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">左高2、右高1，因此根30的BF=+1。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>由高度建立数值判断</h3><div class=\"d17-formula\">BF(v) = h(L(v)) − h(R(v))</div><p>左侧更高：BF &gt; 0</p><p>两侧相同：BF = 0</p><p>右侧更高：BF &lt; 0</p><p class=\"d17-note\">AVL每个结点都需要 BF∈{−1,0,+1}。</p></div></div></div>",
    "goal": "理解BF符号并会计算具体结点",
    "activity": "具体高度与符号对应",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "bf-every-node",
    "title": "根 BF=0 就一定是 AVL 树吗？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "exercise",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>检查整棵树的各个结点</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"BF树形\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"315\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"315\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"130\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"130\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">40</text><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"225\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text><circle cx=\"470\" cy=\"225\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">45</text><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"315\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">5</text><circle cx=\"515\" cy=\"315\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"515\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">左、右主子树都高3，因此根30的BF为0。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">只检查根30就够了吗？还应检查哪些内部结点？</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>不能。结点20的左子树高2、右侧空，因此BF(20)=+2；结点40左侧空、右子树高2，因此BF(40)=−2。</p><p>根平衡不代表整棵树高度平衡；必须检查所有结点。</p></div></details></div></div></div>",
    "goal": "理解所有结点都必须满足高度约束",
    "activity": "独立预测与核对",
    "withheld_results": [
      "BF(20)=+2"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "ll-trigger",
    "title": "插入16后，哪里第一次违反高度限制？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">按BST规则依次插入30、20、16；更新后从插入位置向上检查祖先高度。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>临时状态：30左侧更深</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LL0的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7eafb\" stroke=\"#165d92\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text><circle cx=\"122\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"122\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">30的左子树高2，右侧高0。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>在哪个祖先处首次失衡？</h3><div class=\"d17-steps\"><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>30、20时</b>30的BF=+1，合法</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>插入16后</b>20所在子树的高度升为2</div><div class=\"d17-step\"><b>检查30</b>BF(30)=+2，超过限制</div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">此时BST顺序仍成立，但AVL高度条件暂时不成立。</p></div></div></div>",
    "goal": "从插入位置向上找到最低失衡祖先",
    "activity": "树形、比较和BF对应",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "right-rotate",
    "title": "为什么一次右旋既保序又恢复平衡？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"d17-condensed\"><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>右旋前：根30失衡</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LL0的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7eafb\" stroke=\"#165d92\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text><circle cx=\"122\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"122\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">BF(30)=+2，高度3。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>右旋后：局部根为20</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LL1的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7eafb\" stroke=\"#165d92\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"158\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"164\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"158\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">左右孩子16与30，高度2。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"d17-formula\">① 中序仍为 16 → 20 → 30　　② 三个结点 BF 都为 0</div></div>",
    "goal": "理解LL右旋的链接变换并分别核验顺序与平衡",
    "activity": "旋转前后结构对照",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "rotation-order",
    "title": "中间子树B换了位置，为什么顺序不变？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">一般右旋需要保留整个子树A、B、C的关键字范围，并将中间子树B正确重接。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>结构约束（整棵子树）</h3><div class=\"d17-formula\">A &lt; y &lt; B &lt; z &lt; C</div><p class=\"d17-note\">旋转前 z 为局部根，y 是 z 的左孩子，B 是 y 的右子树。</p><p class=\"d17-note\">旋转后 y 为局部根，z 为 y 的右孩子，B 变为 z 的左子树。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>对应的最小C11链接调整</h3><pre class=\"d17-code\"><code>Node *y = z-&gt;left;\nNode *middle = y-&gt;right;\ny-&gt;right = z;\nz-&gt;left = middle;\nfix(z); fix(y);\nreturn y;</code></pre><p class=\"d17-note\">调用者还要让旧父链接或根指针指向返回的新局部根y。</p></div></div></div>",
    "goal": "解释中间子树重接仍保持BST顺序",
    "activity": "子树范围与C11字段映射",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-single-fails",
    "title": "30、16、20：只对30右旋会怎样？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "exercise",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>原始30、16、20的临时失衡树</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LR0的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30的左孩子16，而20是16的右孩子。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">请先画出仅右旋30后的树，再判断它是否同时满足BST和AVL。</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>单独对30右旋后：新根16，右孩子30，30左孩子20。</p><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LRbad的二叉树示意\"><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"325\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"325\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"249\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#718fab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7eafb\" stroke=\"#165d92\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">16</text><circle cx=\"325\" cy=\"146\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"325\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">30</text><circle cx=\"249\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#7894aa\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><text x=\"249\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193e61\">20</text></svg><p>中序依然为16、20、30，BST顺序成立；但新根16的BF为−2，<b>仍然失衡</b>。</p></div></details></div></div></div>",
    "goal": "借助反例理解单旋可能保序但不恢复平衡",
    "activity": "先预测、后揭示结果",
    "withheld_results": [
      "仍然失衡"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-double-stage1",
    "title": "LR修复第一步：为什么先左旋16？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">LR路径转折处需要先调整失衡祖先的左孩子，才能进行后续有效右旋。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>原始30、16、20结构</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LR0\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">16</text><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">20是16的右孩子，根30仍失衡。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>第一步：对16左旋</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LRmid\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">16</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">20成为30的左孩子，16变成20的左孩子。</p></div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">此时只是双旋的中间状态，不应称作已恢复平衡；下一步还需要对30右旋。</p></div>",
    "goal": "明确双旋第一步作用及其尚未完成状态",
    "activity": "连续结构推演",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-double",
    "title": "LR修复第二步：为什么再右旋30？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>左旋后的中间树</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LRmid\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">16</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">30仍存在高度差，需要第二步。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>第二步右旋后的最终树</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LRdone\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"158\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"164\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">16</text><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"158\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">局部根20，两个孩子分别为16和30。</p></div></div><div class=\"d17-formula\">中序仍为16 → 20 → 30；每个结点的BF均为0</div><p class=\"d17-note\">旋转的两个动作分别改变了什么链接？如何检验它们都合法？</p></div>",
    "goal": "理解双旋完整步骤及其顺序与平衡正确性",
    "activity": "第二步旋转与性质检验",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "mirror-cases",
    "title": "RR和RL怎样通过对称性理解？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">先理解单旋与双旋的机制，再根据左右对称性总结四种路径。</p><table class=\"d17-table\"><thead><tr><th>插入路径</th><th>需要的操作</th><th>机制关系</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>LL 左→左</td><td>对失衡祖先右旋</td><td>单旋</td></tr><tr><td>RR 右→右</td><td>对失衡祖先左旋</td><td>LL的左右镜像</td></tr><tr><td>LR 左→右</td><td>先左旋左孩子，再右旋祖先</td><td>双旋</td></tr><tr><td>RL 右→左</td><td>先右旋右孩子，再左旋祖先</td><td>LR的左右镜像</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"d17-note\">这里针对AVL插入后的最低失衡祖先；AVL删除会出现不同的维护条件，不机械套用。</p></div>",
    "goal": "由LL与LR推导插入失衡的四类结构调整",
    "activity": "对称归纳与条件界定",
    "withheld_results": []
  },
  {
    "id": "independent-avl",
    "title": "新树插入27，如何定位并修复失衡？",
    "section": "avl",
    "role": "exercise",
    "body": "<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>初始合法AVL（独立输入）</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AVL0\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"159\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"159\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"159\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"48\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"159\" cy=\"138\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"159\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"138\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">40</text><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">10</text><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30，左20(10,25)，右40，尚未插入27。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">① 按BST规则插入27；② 判断是否失衡并定位；③ 画出必要旋转后的树，分别检验有序与平衡。</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>27先插入25的右空链接。沿路径向上检查，最低失衡祖先为30，左孩子20的BF为−1。</p><p>先对20左旋，再对30右旋：</p><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AVLdone\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"155\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"155\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"346\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"477\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"48\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7edf9\" stroke=\"#175f91\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">25</text><circle cx=\"155\" cy=\"138\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"155\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"138\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">10</text><circle cx=\"346\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"346\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">27</text><circle cx=\"477\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"477\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">40</text></svg><p>最终根25，左子树20(10)，右子树30(27,40)；中序10、20、25、27、30、40，所有相关结点|BF|≤1。</p></div></details></div></div></div>",
    "goal": "在新输入上独立完成AVL插入、失衡判定和旋转",
    "activity": "先独立完成，再核对",
    "withheld_results": [
      "最终根25",
      "左孩子20的BF为−1"
    ]
  },
